rsonally and I think I'm going to close out with one of my personal favourites. after this this song is the rapture I'm pretty sure and I did play a couple of older tracks that I do think needed more attention at the time but you know how I feel about the rate at which producers are making music and how much of that music just goes under the radar but that's why I love doing this show because I get to show you all that music that does fly under the radar but with that being said there are a couple things that are coming up in the next few weeks where you can find me find some of your favorite local djs and some international acts that are coming to sydney as well in two weeks there is an afro house event happening in marrickville that's just up the road from here i'll be playing there with some other really amazing afro house djs and that event basically is putting a spotlight on your deep house afro house all that fun stuff i'm really excited to play i love playing those genres anyone that knows me does know that so that's really exciting and then there's a couple more like boat parties and things like that that are happening as we get into the warmer months and summer and all that fun stuff which are events i'll let you know about in the coming weeks but thank you all for staying tuned with me this week please have a safe rest of your weekend i'll be back at the same time with the same vibes next week saturday this was the honor show"}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:01:13"}, "track": {"title": "Ngimbonile (feat. De Rose)", "artists": [{"name": "Tycoon & Babalwa M"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:07:00"}, "track": {"title": "Bambi Roof", "artists": [{"name": "Ben Produces & DJ Superman"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:08:00"}, "track": {"title": "Majozi (feat. Scotts Maphuma, CowBoii & Xduppy)", "artists"